 ## Background
-This technique is used in projects like the block-showroom by lardratboy, specifically in `src/scene/instancing.js` and `lattice/recipe.js` [S1, unofficial]. It is also implemented in Unity-based voxel renderers such as UnityGPUMeshVoxelizerPart4/Part5 and Voxel-Shader [S2, S3, S4, unofficial]. The method leverages procedural instancing features available in modern graphics APIs and engines to avoid CPU-side mesh generation for every voxel [S3, S4, unofficial].
